<!DOCTYPE doc [
<!ELEMENT doc - - (p+)>
<!ELEMENT p - - (#PCDATA|b)*>
<!ELEMENT b - - (#PCDATA)>
]>
<doc>
<p>Abc def, <b>bold (a-z)</b>: 0.9 &#233; &#937; &#1046; &#8364; &#20013;</p>
<p>A second paragraph long enough to be broken into more than one line of the page it stands on, which shows that the widths of the glyphs are read from the font.</p>
</doc>
